{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5ZuCVu2PccnsGRenW7T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BiPNoshhvAgafuDXwy9G73","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/arena-ws.Yv35zH/REPORT.md","content":"## Overview\n\nTotal revenue across the period was $7,154.44 from 30 orders, spanning\n2026-05-02 through 2026-05-21. The median order value was $204.95, and four\nproducts sold across four regions.\n\n## Top Products\n\nGadget led on revenue with $2,392.00 from just 16 units across 7 orders, driven\nby its $149.50 unit price. Widget followed at $2,118.94 from 106 units in 10\norders, making it the most frequently ordered item. Doohickey contributed\n$1,513.00 from 17 units, and Sprocket $1,130.50 despite moving 238 units — the\nhighest volume and the lowest revenue, at $4.75 per unit.\n\n## Regional Performance\n\nNorth was the strongest region at $2,176.35 over 8 orders, helped by two Gadget\norders and heavy Sprocket volume. East followed with $1,830.79 from 7 orders,\nthen South at $1,732.48 from 8 orders. West trailed at $1,414.82 from 7 orders,\nits lowest-priced mix among the four. The gap between North and West is\n$761.53, roughly 11% of total revenue.\n\n## Recommendations\n\n- Prioritize Gadget inventory and promotion: 7 orders produced 33% of revenue,\n  the highest revenue per order at $341.71.\n- Review Sprocket pricing; 238 units, a third of all volume, returned only\n  $1,130.50, the weakest revenue of the four products.\n- Apply North's product mix to West, where 7 orders yielded $1,414.82 against\n  North's $2,176.35.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1406,"cache_read_input_tokens":26178,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1406},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"co